      "writtenOn": "2026-10-06T18:39:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for catching, this wasn\u0027t quite right, and actually works better with the order reversed. Updated the implementation and added comments. The integration test now includes a test case sending both PROXY and `X-Forwarded-For` headers and verifies that the forwarded source is honored.\n\nDoes it look good to you now?",
